notes: Open umbrella for Wave 1 instruction honesty. Child tickets are AEP28-ENV-073 through AEP28-ENV-081. Do not extract CAW unless the operator orders a split. Do not remove EPSCOM. GitHub is a public mirror. BIOSECURITY.md stays access policy with one pointer to internal-sdk security docs. Canonical layout and the Architecture layer table must name four rows: kernel, protocol, execution companion and clients. CAW framework stays in the tree as an execution companion and must not appear as a protocol component. Official tree is https://github.com/thePM001/AEP-agent-element-protocol. Close this ticket only after Wave 1 children AEP28-ENV-074, AEP28-ENV-075, AEP28-ENV-077 and AEP28-ENV-078 are closed. Ticket close is coding close.
acceptance: README layout names kernel, protocol, execution companion and clients. CAW is not listed as a protocol component. Public repository is named as https://github.com/thePM001/AEP-agent-element-protocol. BIOSECURITY.md has a pointer to internal-sdk security docs. Child tickets AEP28-ENV-073 through AEP28-ENV-081 exist on the public tree. source_invariants or library-layer-count fails if Canonical layout still names caw-framework as a protocol component. cargo test for aep-base-node lib still passes after copy lands. nla-policy-scan gate coding-completion and project-completion-bac on AEP-Base-Node crate after Wave 1 copy lands. Do not close until AEP28-ENV-074, AEP28-ENV-075, AEP28-ENV-077 and AEP28-ENV-078 are closed.
